  "notes": "Cash basis county, governmental funds only (no business-type funds). Beginning/ending cash are the cash basis fund balances the governmental funds statement rolls forward (p4; ending = cash 4,917,213 + investments 1,258,180, p1/p3); ending_investments is informational. Balance sheet from the governmental funds statement of cash basis assets and fund balances (p3, Total column), whose totals equal the Statement of Net Position (p1). Statement Taxes 4,525,094 split by fund-name evidence: Inheritance Fund 421,463 inheritance tax; County Visitors' Promotion and Improvement Funds 23,628 lodging tax; remainder 4,080,003 (General, Road, 911 funds) stays unlabeled. Detail: General Fund budget schedule (pp5-6, departments not itemized), major fund budget schedules (pp7-8); 17 nonmajor funds recorded from the combining statement Total Nonmajor Funds column (p16) instead of the one-line nonmajor budget schedules (pp9-12) to avoid double counting. Road Bridge Improvement Fund had no receipts. Read pages 1-16 of 16"
}
